1c493b1de4dbb20825c82c25b953b9.avif?t=1773392572\" width=1510 height=490 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf57This might just be the most delicious, wackiest, and most addictive tower defense game ever made!\ud83c\udf57</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u200b\u200bThe story begins at a mysterious BBQ stall</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been chosen as the new Grillmaster! Your foes are not scary monsters, but a cheeky horde of mice drawn by the smell of your skewers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their goal is to nibble everything in sight. Your mission is to protect the grill and keep your skewers safe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926160/extras/a5cf759452012d61eab5ca81d350a462.poster.avif?t=1773392572\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926160/extras/a5cf759452012d61eab5ca81d350a462.webm?t=1773392572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926160/extras/a5cf759452012d61eab5ca81d350a462.mp4?t=1773392572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Skewers Are Your Towers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag, drop, and watch your tasty skewers jump into battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, bounce, and splash. You can even boop enemies right off the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 20 minutes of fast-paced roguelite runs where your only goal is to defend your grill at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926160/extras/6c833adf727c997f2c86912176d6b586.poster.avif?t=1773392572\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926160/extras/6c833adf727c997f2c86912176d6b586.webm?t=1773392572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926160/extras/6c833adf727c997f2c86912176d6b586.mp4?t=1773392572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Perfect Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Grillmasters, each with unique talents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Grillmaster can become the core of a different playstyle, letting you craft your own exclusive skewer squad!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ tasty and powerful foods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether they split, bounce, or knock enemies back,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >combine these effects to master your signature playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ powerful seasonings and items spawn randomly,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >adding constant depth to your playstyle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and making every run a brand new experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926160/extras/73c8f24518e55fca6a75d20a20c781fe.poster.avif?t=1773392572\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926160/extras/73c8f24518e55fca6a75d20a20c781fe.webm?t=1773392572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926160/extras/73c8f24518e55fca6a75d20a20c781fe.mp4?t=1773392572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blazing Fast, Thrilling Fun and Fresh Every Run!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minute to learn, ten minutes to get hooked, twenty minutes to never stop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is unique, and every skewer brings surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926160/extras/6f2321f921e2fb17dc531f141dc2c926.poster.avif?t=1773392572\" width=1170 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926160/extras/6f2321f921e2fb17dc531f141dc2c926.webm?t=1773392572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926160/extras/6f2321f921e2fb17dc531f141dc2c926.mp4?t=1773392572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey Grill Masters, are you ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grill Zone: No Hungry Creeps Allowed. Stay out, or you might become the next skewer!</p>","developers":["Fake Owls"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926160/aeab8a248017350643c34f291e2815663aa04c36/header.jpg?t=1773392572","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3926160/1452527110/3007cc62823795e322b7dcf644923b8775824d04/1769768483/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773392570","dash_h264":"https://